      "observed": "The turbine hall has two levels of continuous framed glazing, a low apron walkway and separate exposed tailrace outlets. The concrete crest has sloped buttresses, deeply recessed gate bays and a control tower and cranes. Two rockfill flanks tie into the abutments."
